TYPES.md §8.2, §11.6: a symbol resolved to a case is that case written bare; a case with a
required field cannot be, E3302; one whose fields all have defaults takes them.
-- a/a.canon --
/// A.
package a

/// K.
enum K { pick }

/// Shape.
variant Shape {
  /// Dot.
  dot {
    /// Size.
    size: Int = 2
  }
  /// Box.
  box {
    /// Width.
    w: Int
  }
}

/// P.
type P(k: K) = match k {
  pick => Shape
}

/// Thing.
record Thing {
  /// K.
  k: K
  /// Payload.
  p: P(k)
}

/// Things.
let things: [Thing] = [
  { k: pick, p: dot },
  { k: pick, p: box },
]
-- project.canon --
project demo {
  canon: "0.1"
}
-- findings.txt --
error[E3302]  a/a.canon:37:17
  things[1].p: a.Shape.box needs field w
  expected by a/a.canon:31 (p: P(k))

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
